<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0f15">
<title>MARCINHO · Vendas online e mapa de negócios locais</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.css">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--bg:#0a0f15;--sf:#131c28;--sf2:#1a2535;--ln:rgba(255,255,255,.08);--ln2:rgba(255,255,255,.17);--tx:#eef2f7;--mu:#9aa7ba;--gd:#e2c283;--gd2:#b8944d;--jd:#46d6a4;--r:18px;
--fd:"Fraunces",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;--fb:"Manrope",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif}
html{background:var(--bg);scroll-padding-top:90px}
body{font-family:var(--fb);font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--tx);min-height:100vh;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
background:radial-gradient(900px 520px at 8% -8%,rgba(226,194,131,.10),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(800px 600px at 100% 30%,rgba(70,214,164,.06),transparent 60%),var(--bg);background-attachment:fixed}
button,input{font:inherit;color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gd);outline-offset:2px}
.w{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 24px 90px}
/* header */
.top{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(10,15,21,.8);backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(1.3);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px) saturate(1.3);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ln);padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
.top-in{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:13px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px}
.brand{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:600;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:.3em;line-height:1;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f6e6bd,#c9a25b 55%,#f1dba2);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;white-space:nowrap}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-left:auto;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;padding:2px}
.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.tab{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--mu);padding:9px 16px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .2s,color .2s}
.tab:hover{color:var(--tx);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
.tab.on{background:rgba(226,194,131,.14);color:var(--gd);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(226,194,131,.28)}
.tab .new{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;background:var(--jd);color:#06281d;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:99px;margin-left:6px}
/* sections */
.section{display:none}
.section.on{display:block;animation:fade .35s ease}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}
.section-title{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(28px,4.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin-bottom:12px}
.section-title em,h1 em{font-style:normal}
.section-desc{color:var(--mu);max-width:640px;margin-bottom:30px}
.sub-title{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:500;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:54px 0 8px;color:var(--tx)}
.calc-box .sub-title{margin-top:0}
/* hero */
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:24px 0 52px}
.badge{display:inline-block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gd);background:rgba(226,194,131,.1);border:1px solid rgba(226,194,131,.28);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:99px}
h1{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(36px,5.6vw,66px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:22px 0 18px}
.sub{color:var(--mu);font-size:17px;max-width:520px;margin-bottom:28px}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.radar{width:100%;max-width:400px;justify-self:center}
.radar .rg{fill:none;stroke:rgba(226,194,131,.4);stroke-dasharray:3 7;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:center;animation:ring .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) both}
.radar .r1{fill:rgba(226,194,131,.07);animation-delay:.1s}.radar .r2{animation-delay:.3s}.radar .r3{animation-delay:.5s}
.radar text{fill:var(--mu);font:600 11px var(--fb)}
.radar .dt{animation:fade .6s ease 1s both}
@keyframes ring{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.35)}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}}
/* cards */
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:18px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(330px,1fr));gap:18px}
.card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sf2),var(--sf));border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:var(--r);padding:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;transition:border-color .25s}
.card:hover{border-color:rgba(226,194,131,.35)}
.card.wide{grid-column:1/-1;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(226,194,131,.14),rgba(70,214,164,.06) 60%,var(--sf));border-color:rgba(226,194,131,.3)}
.card.wide .row{margin:0;flex:none}
.card h3{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:500;font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.card p{color:var(--mu);font-size:15px}
.card p strong{color:var(--tx);font-weight:600}
.tip{margin-top:30px;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:var(--r);background:rgba(70,214,164,.07);border:1px solid rgba(70,214,164,.25);color:#cfeee3}
.tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tag{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 11px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:var(--mu)}
.tag.p{background:rgba(255,107,129,.13);color:#ff9aab}.tag.tk{background:rgba(70,214,214,.12);color:#7fe3e3}.tag.sh{background:rgba(255,150,80,.13);color:#ffb487}.tag.mp{background:rgba(226,194,131,.14);color:var(--gd)}
.pr{font-size:14px;color:#c6d0de;white-space:pre-wrap;max-height:118px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;transition:max-height .5s ease;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 70%,transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 70%,transparent)}
.card.open .pr{max-height:1000px;-webkit-mask-image:none;mask-image:none}
.row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:auto;padding-top:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{flex:1;min-height:44px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--ln2);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);color:var(--tx);font-weight:600;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,border-color .2s,color .2s}
.btn:hover{border-color:var(--gd);color:var(--gd)}
.btn.m{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f1d9a0,#c9a25b);border-color:transparent;color:#1b1407}
.btn.m:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);color:#1b1407}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:wait}
.btn.wide{width:100%;flex:none}
/* filters */
input[type=text],input[type=number]{width:100%;min-height:48px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--ln);background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);outline:none;transition:border-color .2s}
input[type=text]::placeholder{color:#697689}
input[type=text]:focus,input[type=number]:focus{border-color:var(--gd)}
#q{margin-bottom:16px}
.chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}
.chip{border:1px solid var(--ln);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);color:var(--mu);padding:7px 15px;border-radius:99px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;transition:all .2s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.chip:hover{color:var(--tx);border-color:var(--ln2)}
.chip.on{background:rgba(226,194,131,.16);color:var(--gd);border-color:rgba(226,194,131,.45)}
.chip i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c,var(--gd))}
.cnt{color:var(--mu);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:22px 0 14px}
.empty{color:var(--mu);padding:30px;text-align:center;border:1px dashed var(--ln2);border-radius:var(--r);grid-column:1/-1}
/* steps */
.step{position:relative;margin:0 0 14px 22px;padding:22px 24px;background:var(--sf);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:var(--r)}
.step::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-22px;top:30px;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gd);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(226,194,131,.16)}
.step::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:-18px;top:46px;bottom:-18px;width:2px;background:var(--ln)}
.step:last-of-type::after{display:none}
.step-num{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gd);margin-bottom:2px}
.step h4,.error-content h4,.day-content h4{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:500;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:6px}
.step p,.step ul,.error-content p,.day-content p{color:var(--mu);font-size:15px}
.step ul{margin:10px 0 0 18px}.step ul li::marker{color:var(--gd)}
.check-item{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:13px 16px;border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:14px;cursor:pointer;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);transition:border-color .2s}
.check-item:hover{border-color:var(--ln2)}
.checklist{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;margin-top:8px}
.check-box{flex:none;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:7px;border:2px solid var(--ln2);margin-top:1px;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:all .2s}
.check-item.done .check-box{background:var(--jd);border-color:var(--jd)}
.check-item.done .check-box::after{content:"";width:5px;height:10px;border:solid #06281d;border-width:0 2.5px 2.5px 0;transform:rotate(45deg) translate(-1px,-1px)}
.check-item.done .check-label{color:var(--mu);text-decoration:line-through}
.check-progress{color:var(--jd);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-top:6px}
.error-item,.day-card{display:flex;gap:18px;padding:20px 22px;margin-bottom:12px;background:var(--sf);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:var(--r)}
.error-num,.day-num{flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--fd);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;background:rgba(226,194,131,.12);color:var(--gd)}
.glossary-item{padding:18px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ln);display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:20px}
.glossary-term{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:20px;color:var(--gd)}
.glossary-def{color:var(--mu)}
.calc-box{max-width:620px;padding:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sf2),var(--sf));border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:var(--r);margin-bottom:10px}
.calc-field{margin-bottom:16px}.calc-field label,.field>label{display:block;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--mu);margin-bottom:7px}
.calc-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:11px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ln);color:var(--mu)}
.calc-line strong{color:var(--tx)}
.calc-highlight{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(226,194,131,.12);border:1px solid rgba(226,194,131,.35)}
.calc-highlight strong{font-family:var(--fd);font-size:28px;color:var(--gd)}
.ft{margin-top:70px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--ln);color:#6f7c90;font-size:13px;text-align:center}
/* mapa */
.mapgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 360px;gap:20px;align-items:start}
.mapcol{position:sticky;top:84px}
#map{height:min(70vh,640px);min-height:380px;border-radius:var(--r);border:1px solid var(--ln2);overflow:hidden;background:#0d141d}
.mapbar{margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mu);min-height:22px}
.panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;padding:22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--sf2),var(--sf));border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:var(--r)}
.inline{display:flex;gap:8px}.inline .btn{flex:none}
.seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border-radius:99px}
.seg button{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--mu);padding:10px;border-radius:99px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.seg button.on{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f1d9a0,#c9a25b);color:#1b1407}
.mini{display:flex;gap:16px}
.link{background:none;border:0;color:var(--gd);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.switch{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:14px;color:var(--mu);cursor:pointer}
.switch input{width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--gd)}
.results{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(310px,1fr));gap:14px}
.res{--c:var(--gd);position:relative;padding:16px 18px 14px 22px;background:var(--sf);border:1px solid var(--ln);border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .2s}
.res::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:14px;bottom:14px;width:4px;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;background:var(--c)}
.res:hover,.res.hl{border-color:var(--c)}
.res-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:baseline}
.res h4{font-family:var(--fd);font-weight:500;font-size:18px;line-height:1.25}
.dist{flex:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--jd)}
.res-m{color:var(--mu);font-size:13.5px;margin:3px 0 10px}
.res-m b{color:var(--c);font-weight:700}
.res-a{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.res-a a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--tx);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 13px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
.res-a a:hover{background:rgba(226,194,131,.2);color:var(--gd)}
.tagx{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#ffb487;background:rgba(255,150,80,.12);padding:5px 11px;border-radius:99px}
.note{margin-top:22px;color:#76839a;font-size:13px;max-width:680px}
.leaflet-container{font-family:var(--fb);background:#0d141d}
.leaflet-popup-content-wrapper,.leaflet-popup-tip{background:var(--sf2);color:var(--tx);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.leaflet-popup-content{margin:14px 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
.leaflet-container a.leaflet-popup-close-button{color:var(--mu)}
.leaflet-control-attribution{background:rgba(10,15,21,.8)!important;color:#8a97ab!important}
.leaflet-control-attribution a{color:var(--gd)!important}
.leaflet-bar a{background:var(--sf2);color:var(--tx);border-color:var(--ln)}
.pin{display:block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c);border:2.5px solid #0a0f15;box-shadow:0 0 0 1.5px var(--c),0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
.you{display:block;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gd);border:3px solid #0a0f15;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(226,194,131,.3)}
@media (max-width:980px){
.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.radar{max-width:210px;justify-self:start}
.mapgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mapcol{position:static}#map{height:58vh}
.card.wide{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
}
@media (max-width:640px){
.w{padding:24px 16px 80px}
.top-in{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px}.brand{font-size:20px}.tabs{width:100%;margin:0}
.glossary-item{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}
.grid,.grid-2,.results{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.inline{flex-direction:column}.inline .btn{width:100%}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top"><div class="top-in">
  <div class="brand">MARCINHO</div>
  <nav class="tabs" id="tabs" aria-label="Seções">
    <button class="tab on" data-s="inicio">Início</button>
    <button class="tab" data-s="mapa">Mapa de negócios<span class="new">novo</span></button>
    <button class="tab" data-s="primeiros">Primeiros passos</button>
    <button class="tab" data-s="prompts">Prompts</button>
    <button class="tab" data-s="ferramentas">Ferramentas</button>
    <button class="tab" data-s="glossario">Glossário</button>
  </nav>
</div></header>
<div class="w">
 
<div class="section on" id="s-inicio">
  <div class="hero">
    <div>
      <span class="badge">TikTok Shop, Shopee e vendas locais</span>
      <h1>Comece a vender do zero e encontre clientes perto de você.</h1>
      <p class="sub">Passo a passo, prompts de IA prontos, calculadora de lucro e agora um mapa que lista padarias, pizzarias, salões e outros negócios num raio de 1, 5 ou 10 km.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <button class="btn m" style="flex:none" onclick="goTo('mapa')">Abrir o mapa de negócios</button>
        <button class="btn" style="flex:none" onclick="goTo('primeiros')">Ver o passo a passo</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <svg class="radar" viewBox="0 0 360 360" role="img" aria-label="Círculos de 1, 5 e 10 km ao redor de um ponto">
      <circle class="rg r3" cx="180" cy="180" r="168"/><circle class="rg r2" cx="180" cy="180" r="106"/><circle class="rg r1" cx="180" cy="180" r="48"/>
      <text x="180" y="30" text-anchor="middle">10 km</text><text x="180" y="92" text-anchor="middle">5 km</text><text x="180" y="150" text-anchor="middle">1 km</text>
      <g class="dt"><circle cx="150" cy="168" r="5" fill="#e2c283"/><circle cx="208" cy="198" r="5" fill="#ff6b6b"/><circle cx="122" cy="120" r="5" fill="#46d6a4"/><circle cx="240" cy="116" r="5" fill="#ff7ab8"/><circle cx="96" cy="236" r="5" fill="#5ea8ff"/><circle cx="262" cy="248" r="5" fill="#ffd166"/><circle cx="180" cy="300" r="5" fill="#e2c283"/><circle cx="64" cy="170" r="5" fill="#ff9f5a"/>
      <circle cx="180" cy="180" r="14" fill="rgba(226,194,131,.25)"/><circle cx="180" cy="180" r="7" fill="#e2c283"/></g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="card wide">
      <div><h3>Mapa de negócios por raio</h3><p>Toque num ponto do mapa, escolha 1, 5 ou 10 km e os tipos de estabelecimento. Veja telefone, WhatsApp e quem ainda não tem site.</p></div>
      <div class="row"><button class="btn m" onclick="goTo('mapa')">Abrir o mapa</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Nunca vendi nada online</h3><p>Comece em <strong>Primeiros passos</strong>: da conta de vendedor até a primeira venda, com checklist que guarda seu progresso.</p><div class="row"><button class="btn" onclick="goTo('primeiros')">Abrir primeiros passos</button></div></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Quero conteúdo pronto</h3><p>Mais de 60 prompts para copiar no ChatGPT, Claude ou Gemini, separados por nicho, tipo e plataforma.</p><div class="row"><button class="btn" onclick="goTo('prompts')">Ver prompts</button></div></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Quero calcular meus ganhos</h3><p>A <strong>calculadora de comissão</strong> mostra quanto sobra por venda no TikTok Shop e na Shopee.</p><div class="row"><button class="btn" onclick="goTo('ferramentas')">Abrir ferramentas</button></div></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Não entendo os termos</h3><p>O <strong>glossário</strong> explica UGC, CTA, live commerce, afiliado e outros termos em linguagem simples.</p><div class="row"><button class="btn" onclick="goTo('glossario')">Ver glossário</button></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="tip"><strong>Dica:</strong> escolha uma plataforma, siga o plano de 7 dias e use os prompts para criar conteúdo. Consistência vale mais que perfeição.</div>
</div>
 
<div class="section" id="s-mapa">
  <h2 class="section-title">Mapa de negócios por raio</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">Toque ou clique no mapa para escolher o ponto. A lista mostra os estabelecimentos dos tipos marcados dentro do raio, do mais perto ao mais longe.</p>
  <div class="mapgrid">
    <div class="mapcol">
      <div id="map" role="application" aria-label="Mapa interativo"></div>
      <div class="mapbar" id="mapStatus" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="panel">
      <div class="field"><label for="addr">Buscar endereço ou cidade</label>
        <div class="inline"><input type="text" id="addr" placeholder="Ex.: Av. Paulista, São Paulo"><button class="btn m" id="addrGo">Buscar</button></div></div>
      <button class="btn wide" id="geoBtn">Usar minha localização</button>
      <div class="field"><label>Raio de busca</label>
        <div class="seg" id="radius"><button data-r="1000" class="on">1 km</button><button data-r="5000">5 km</button><button data-r="10000">10 km</button></div></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Tipos de estabelecimento</label>
        <div class="chips" id="cats"></div>
        <div class="mini"><button class="link" id="catAll">Marcar todos</button><button class="link" id="catNone">Limpar</button></div></div>
      <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="onlyNoSite"> Mostrar só os que não informam site</label>
      <div class="row"><button class="btn m" id="searchBtn">Buscar neste ponto</button><button class="btn" id="csvBtn">Baixar CSV</button></div>
    </aside>
  </div>
